{"availability":"available","full":"Muktaditbf/dude-wheres-my-stuff","name":"dude-wheres-my-stuff","description":"🧦 Tell it where you put your stuff. Ask it later. Get roasted. A funny, private, offline-first app that remembers where you put things.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-11T13:04:10Z","updated":"2026-10-11T13:25:47Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://muktaditbf.github.io/dude-wheres-my-stuff/","topics":["funny","local-first","lost-and-found","offline-first","productivity","pwa","react","tailwindcss","typescript","vite"],"demo":"https://muktaditbf.github.io/dude-wheres-my-stuff/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T21:13:16.759Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T21:13:16.759Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T21:13:16.759Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:50:56.112Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T21:13:16.759Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Tell it where you put your stuff. Ask it later. Get roasted.","A free, private, works-offline app that remembers where you put things,","Stashing something you already have moves it (and keeps the history) instead of creating a duplicate."],"features":["🗣️ Talk like a human. No forms. One box understands \"keys in the blue bowl\", \"where's my passport?\", \"what's in the black bag?\" and \"lent my drill to Rafi\". A live preview shows how it understood you before you press…","🔍 Forgiving search. Typos (wher are my glases), synonyms (specs finds glasses, clicker finds the remote) and partial names (remote finds the TV remote). If it isn't sure, it asks \"did you mean…\" instead of guessing.","💀 \"Not there\" mode. Every move is remembered, so you get the earlier spots and the item's usual spot.","🤝 Lent stuff. \"Rafi borrowed my drill\" is remembered too, with an appropriately judgmental timer.","📸 Evidence photos. Snap where you put it. Photos are shrunk before saving."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Muktaditbf/dude-wheres-my-stuff/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fc1a3813054dd5dd0e1178b916b91fd90c270220d77ad9fc9c7f34f84191dfe4","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:56.227Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:56.227Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Tell it where you put your stuff. Ask it later. Get roasted.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Muktaditbf/dude-wheres-my-stuff/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No account, no server, no analytics, no cookies, no third-party requests.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Muktaditbf/dude-wheres-my-stuff/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"fc1a3813054dd5dd0e1178b916b91fd90c270220d77ad9fc9c7f34f84191dfe4","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Muktaditbf/dude-wheres-my-stuff/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:56.227Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T13:25:47Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Muktaditbf/dude-wheres-my-stuff/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:56.228Z","hash":"fc1a3813054dd5dd0e1178b916b91fd90c270220d77ad9fc9c7f34f84191dfe4","originalBytes":10537,"storedBytes":10537,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:56.112Z","subjects":["Browser extensions & PWAs"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Design","subjects":["Browser extensions & PWAs"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Browser extensions & PWAs","source":"metadata","match":"pwa"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Android","Apple","Mobile","Templates & UI components","Privacy & security"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://muktaditbf.github.io/dude-wheres-my-stuff/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-18T21:20:22.662Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T21:20:22.662Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-18T21:20:22.6